A||||24||fieroX||camaro guys and their stories||||1||
Z||000000||fieroX||11-21-2001||09:51 PM||||today at work I start talking to this guy that drives a newer model z28.  Its like a 1996 or so.  Anyway we start talking about racing, and he tells me he has a corvette LT4 in there, that is all stock.  and its and automatic.  So he tells me it runs 0-60 in 4.2 and runs the 1/4 in 12.5.  It also tops out at 185 mph.  And he delivers pizzas in this car.  So I say "you want to race a lumina v6"?  he is like "get out of here, its a v6, Ill smoke it"  I didnt tell him this certain lumina has an L67 and has run 12.747@108.25.  He says to me "do you know anything about engines"  I say "no" very sarcastically.  He is like well my engine has 2 more cylinders so its faster.  I say "so your car runs 12.5 huh?" what are your 60 foots?  he is like "whats that?"  I say what is you time to 60 foot, he says I race the 1/4 not the 60 foot.  this guy is a total dumbass.  so anyway he has an appointment to get smoked by my fiero soon.  I just have to finish my engine swap first.  Ill show him what supercharged v6 is all about.<BR>12.5  <IMG SRC="http://www.plaudersmilies.de/lach.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif"> ||||reg||1
