Z||000002||85ZainoGT||11-22-2001||12:02 AM||||a stock 96 z28 will run no better than 13.9 1/4 miles, thats my guess anyways..<P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1987 Gold GT 2.8L<BR>All the options :)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SigPic2222.jpg"> <BR>NEW pics are coming SOON hopefully... geez!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Brandon86SE||11-22-2001||12:25 AM||||ROFLMFAO!!!!!!!  That's absolutely hilarious!  Car ignorant people are always good for a laugh.  It's a "Corvette LT4" in his STOCK Camaro, eh?  lol  guess he doesn't know that the camaro/trans am/ low end corvette share that engine.  and his "2 more cylinders, so It's faster" that's even better!  Can I please see this guy go up against a TT Supra.  It only has 4 cylinders, so it must do like 25s!  ROFL   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Oh, this makes my night.  Thank you<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Pyric||11-22-2001||01:10 AM||||You've got NOTHING to worry about.  All you need is a quick start to smoke one of those. <BR>I smoked one in a 110hp 4 cylinder.  The idiot driving was spinning his tires in the same spot where I left him while I was 2 blocks away.  <P>Guys like that don't understand that you could have the fastest car in the world, but if you don't have traction... your going nowhere fast. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||fieroX||11-22-2001||03:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Brandon86SE:<BR><B>Can I please see this guy go up against a TT Supra.  It only has 4 cylinders, so it must do like 25s! <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>actually the TT's have the 3.0 liter v6.  Those cars are awesome, Id love to have one.  I found a video of one on a chassis dyno, making 879 hp at the wheels.  It sounded like the wrath of a demon inside that engine!  <BR>As for worrying about that guy beating my fiero, that will be one cold day in hell when that happens.  <BR>One more funny thing he said.  I told him my friends Lumina has a 75 shot of nitrous and he says "well my car would whoop it with nitrous, so there" and I said, "well then you both can have nitrous but you have to pull 2 spark plug wires, and run 6cyl vs 6cyl"  he says, "Ill still beat it"  I laughed my ass off.  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000006||fieroX||11-22-2001||03:07 AM||||Ok one more thing that just popped in my head, he also said the engine is all stock, and makes 385 horsepower, and the original engine that was in there made 320.  But his catalatic (thats how he pronounced it) converters are plugged and it takes away 55% of that horsepower gain, so hes only making like 340 horse which is 330 at the wheels.  This guy is some major entertainment, they should make a comedy movie about the crap he says.||||reg||1
