Z||000012||fieroX||11-23-2001||12:57 AM||||this guy is a bad apple, and the worst part is, no matter what this car actually runs, its a v8, my car has nothing on his (right now).  So all I can do is get my engine swap completed this winter, and next spring if he still works there, well, bye bye!<BR>One more thing he said that was pretty funny, he said it has a 1996 z06 rear end.  Im like ok Ill see about that.  I go outside and look under the rear of his car to discover a solid rear axle housing.  I tell him "you do realize that corvettes have independent rear suspension, and you have a solid rear?" he is like "what?"  and I try to explain to him how an independent rear works with half shafts and all, so he finally told me that just the posi unit was from the vette.  Did they make the z06 in 96?||||reg||1
